        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nikki Sixx, Mike Tyson, Bobby Stewart\n- Bands: Mötley Crüe\n- Topics: band reunion, boxing career, training\n\nFacts:\n- In 1974, Bobby Stewart won the National Golden Gloves Tournament as a light heavyweight.\n- Bobby Stewart is best remembered as Mike Tyson's first trainer.\n- Mike Tyson won his first 19 professional fights by knockout.\n- Mike Tyson won 12 of his first 19 professional fights by knockout in the first round.\n- Nikki Sixx, bassist of Mötley Crüe, compared the band's reunion to seeing Mike Tyson fight.",
